"every version needs different libraries, it runs inside a sealed container "
"of its own that Steam downloads separately. If that container is missing or "
"the version was extracted incompletely, the game does not start, and Steam "
"says nothing beyond the game having exited right away. This page looks into "
"the files to find out why."

